{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_070_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_070_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2deb2745c36bd254b267d2c4728522e0ea17f3a7a9fbd4191c258cdbbb5dc641", "ja": "（そろそろ撮影の時間だけど、恵美はどこだろう？\n現場に向かう前に、新曲のことも伝えないと……）", "zh": "（差不多到拍摄时间了，惠美去哪儿了呢？\n去现场之前，还得把新歌的事告诉她……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_070_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_070_1001_020meg", "source_sha256": "5b48b843f7c21ee5b2e0485feab4fd44ec2ebd49b0e9ed65b3bc4cb5c2b99527", "ja": "ていうか、今から出番は増えないよ～。\n台本、もう先のほうまでもらっちゃってるしさ！", "zh": "再说，现在也不会临时增加戏份啦～。剧本我都已经拿到后面的部分了嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_070_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_070_1002_018ele", "source_sha256": "455a0fab037d58b581b80806a719cef1ad455728961747816b82429bff5bdc3a", "ja": "そっか～、残念……。\nあっ、じゃあメグミは、ドラマの続き知ってるノ？", "zh": "这样啊～真遗憾……\n啊，对了，那惠，你知道电视剧后面的剧情吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_070_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_070_1003_020meg", "source_sha256": "031c50ae5e999610fccdf5a68e3924baf8e8fdffdee50c00ef98f4b136535a84", "ja": "いちおう、ラスト直前までは知ってるけど……\nエレナ、アタシの口からは言えないからね？", "zh": "我知道的也只是到结局前一刻为止……  \n艾蕾娜，我可不能亲口告诉你哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_070_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_070_1004_018ele", "source_sha256": "f2a4f3761f0aa74ff3c177a148bb601544f25573d6e51bb0101fc716cc0dac80", "ja": "え～！　メグミ、ちょっとだけでいいから……ネ？\nねえねえ、ヒントだけでもいいから教えて～！", "zh": "诶～！惠美，只要稍微透露一点点就好……好吗？\n呐呐，哪怕只告诉我提示也好，告诉我嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_070_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_070_1005_017kth", "source_sha256": "20106a7972549592247a8da66e1aeeca4d5955ae88de3ec802fc905500bc556f", "ja": "ふふっ。エレナってば……先を知りたい気持ちは\nわかるけど、恵美が困ってるよ？", "zh": "呵呵。艾蕾娜真是的……我明白你想提前知道后续的心情，但惠美都为难了哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_070_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_070_1006_018ele", "source_sha256": "5f959ac6cd6263d43362d454f411fca40149db9c16549ecf8e93e897145f2cbf", "ja": "あっ、そっか。しゃべっちゃダメなんだっけ……\nうう～、でも気になるヨ～！", "zh": "啊，对哦。不能说出来来着……\n呜呜～可是人家很在意嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_070_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_070_1007_020meg", "source_sha256": "28ec22cabd7db62a2f15471443219f09b54d63cd670439f315c7fe49a6e74f88", "ja": "にゃはは。ま、楽しみにしててよ！", "zh": "呀哈哈。总之，敬请期待吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_070_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_070_1008_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_070_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_070_1009_p", "source_sha256": "fa986f7e1e604d5c7cdfb17b0876c8b43b342e78bb552ea57c250798ce43fddc", "ja": "お疲れさま……恵美、ここにいたんだな。\nそろそろ、撮影現場に行く時間だぞ。", "zh": "辛苦了……惠美，原来你在这里啊。\n差不多该去拍摄现场了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_070_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_070_1010_020meg", "source_sha256": "ae1a96e4f655bef6a775f6f0ac10cf82d1c3170a15b115236abe7d85e1b9f50d", "ja": "えっ、もうそんな時間！？", "zh": "诶，已经到那个时间了吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_070_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_070_1011_p", "source_sha256": "cd4e8331e35b087c5946b67694a7b8ee185507ac77b64a565a3a26e01ceb2276", "ja": "それと、劇場を出る前に話しておきたい事があるんだ。\n次の公演なんだけど……。", "zh": "还有，在离开剧场之前，我有件事想跟你谈谈。\n是关于下次公演的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_070_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_070_1012_p", "source_sha256": "4dfdea479aa5f825f029a1d802c876d45cc032a70d09528732f2f2b4e135f510", "ja": "恵美に、新曲を歌ってもらいたいと思ってるんだ。\nいいか？", "zh": "我想让惠美来唱新歌。\n可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_070_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_070_1013_020meg", "source_sha256": "339c793c05a4151b79f470e19719454bc03388ad1fab259483bbc85163d01f74", "ja": "えっ！　新曲……アタシが！？\n{$P$}、冗談じゃないよね？", "zh": "诶！新歌……让我来唱！？  \n{$P$}，你不是在开玩笑吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_070_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_070_1014_p", "source_sha256": "e9b6b445d3e3cae2ef8e64d8143131adb2c31d385e003b02c7d51e7b208fae70", "ja": "もちろん、本当だよ！　ただ、ドラマの撮影と\n同時進行になるから、少し慌ただしくなるけど。", "zh": "当然是真的啊！不过要和电视剧的拍摄同时进行，可能会有点忙乱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_070_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_070_1015_020meg", "source_sha256": "7b629e0082594e50a55e80f8da1abe9a6d280c013490cdd07a512e574b496f64", "ja": "うん、それは全然大丈夫だけど……\nアタシの新曲かぁ……。", "zh": "嗯，那倒完全没问题……\n我的新歌啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_070_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_070_1016_018ele", "source_sha256": "fa4ab14f790a783c88396025a91a219255d2c6b100e0c62cdce40f2fcff24aec", "ja": "おめでとう、メグミ！　次の公演は、\nメグミの新曲が聞けるんだネ♪　楽しみだヨ～。", "zh": "恭喜你，惠美！下次公演就能听到惠美的新歌了呢♪好期待呀～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_070_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_070_1017_017kth", "source_sha256": "f6cadccf6e2b7c8a6ab75080b3704f9d468f1fcf38d243f3ac71d27d98664bf2", "ja": "あの、{$P$}。よかったら\n私にも、公演のお手伝いをさせてください！", "zh": "那个，{$P$}。如果可以的话，也请让我帮忙准备公演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_070_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_070_1018_018ele", "source_sha256": "d53153d5fe310afc6cdfee54724107d6b4a0bfb5f111221e95b468b320650d51", "ja": "あっ、コトハばっかりズルいヨ～？\n{$P$}、ワタシも手伝う！", "zh": "啊，只有琴叶这样太狡猾啦～？\n{$P$}，我也来帮忙！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_070_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_070_1019_p", "source_sha256": "40eae21bb2d1aacc461c2059cdfe07d2804f361b891c3a122416178e95e4419a", "ja": "ふたりはこう言ってくれてるけど……恵美、どうだ？", "zh": "她们俩都这么说了……惠美，你觉得呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_070_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_070_1020_020meg", "source_sha256": "779d94e49f2756cce9a27b07525b34f33d0d629147bbe5943ead0d223f067010", "ja": "そんなの、いいに決まってるじゃん♪\n琴葉、エレナ、よろしく！", "zh": "那当然好啦♪\n琴叶、艾蕾娜，拜托你们了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_070_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_070_1021_018ele", "source_sha256": "9ff4a9206abc5bd6ec755b8f2e691d1b7998d95eb5dc2f53e3ae78da00dd6f60", "ja": "エヘヘ、そうこなくっちゃ！\nみんなでがんばろうネ♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，就该这样嘛！\n大家一起加油吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_070_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_070_1022_017kth", "source_sha256": "61509eb40f5af0065c6de111167df0c2298483aab3e2b72856f0da7493aa6369", "ja": "うん、忙しくなりそうだね！　……あれ？　ところで\n{$P$}、時間は大丈夫ですか？", "zh": "嗯，感觉会忙起来呢！……咦？话说回来\n{$P$}，时间上还来得及吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_070_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_070_1023_p", "source_sha256": "eb8fea263f3391d2dd4e04adc400c418a0e3ede1b3a05e7e3f44d68e0264d247", "ja": "あっ！　そろそろ出た方がいいな！", "zh": "啊！差不多该出发了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_070_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_070_1024_020meg", "source_sha256": "74f5ceb7ef54351452416b519b2fd9e486f9ef46a22ea0f49210d37e5b2699de", "ja": "わわっ！？　じゃあアタシ、パパッと準備してくる！\n{$P$}、車で待ってて！", "zh": "哇哇！？那我这就火速去准备！\n{$P$}，在车上等我哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_070_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_070_1025_p", "source_sha256": "26ae2cc279c1cf39dddb0e16363d6a73725f71b65417e0e235fb02fc679ce0a9", "ja": "（次の公演、恵美は快諾だったな。\n忙しくなるし、万全のサポートをしていかないとな！）", "zh": "（下场公演，惠美答应得很爽快。接下来会忙起来，我得做好万全的支持才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
